If there's tail winds.

00:26:54.265 --> 00:26:56.740
(Ray and Neil laugh)

00:26:56.740 --> 00:26:58.830
With a tail wind, 50,000 years.

00:26:58.830 --> 00:27:00.070
- Wow.

00:27:00.070 --> 00:27:01.616
I find that, I find that--

00:27:01.616 --> 00:27:02.824
- It's sad.

00:27:02.824 --> 00:27:03.921
- I was gonna say, I find that depressing.

00:27:03.921 --> 00:27:05.260
- It's sad.
- It's very depressing.

00:27:05.260 --> 00:27:07.700
