so that some generation,

00:27:23.460 --> 00:27:25.760
a thousand generations down lands,

00:27:25.760 --> 00:27:28.033
enters the space of a,

00:27:29.197 --> 00:27:31.520
the sector where you
have the nearest star?

00:27:31.520 --> 00:27:33.413
This is not sensible.

00:27:33.413 --> 00:27:36.190
- [Ray] Yeah, it's really
not practical at all.

00:27:36.190 --> 00:27:37.807
- So, we need warp drive.

00:27:37.807 --> 00:27:38.640
- [Ray] We need warp drives, yeah.

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.473
Can you work on that, please?
- Yeah, I'll work on it.

00:27:39.473 --> 00:27:41.210
- I've got people, I've got men.

00:27:41.210 --> 00:27:43.450
Okay, how about this, this is nice.

00:27:43.450 --> 00:27:45.270
This is from Umma Claire on Instagram.

00:27:45.270 --> 00:27:47.037
She said, "Hi, my name is Umma Claire.

00:27:47.037 --> 00:27:50.497
"My family and I always listen
to you on our way to school.

00:27:50.497 --> 00:27:53.917
