00:28:03.890 --> 00:28:04.840
- Ooh.

00:28:04.840 --> 00:28:06.620
- Good question, Umma.

00:28:06.620 --> 00:28:09.000
- Nobody is close to doing that now,

00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:12.360
but when China says
they wanna do something,

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:15.120
