they just do it,

00:28:15.120 --> 00:28:17.920
'cause they have that
power over their resources

00:28:17.920 --> 00:28:20.290
in ways that democracies don't.

00:28:20.290 --> 00:28:23.250
We have to kinda all agree,
the population has to agree.

00:28:23.250 --> 00:28:24.550
Not so in China.

00:28:24.550 --> 00:28:26.818
China just decides as a country,
this is our next mission.

00:28:26.818 --> 00:28:27.962
- [Ray] We're doing it, we're doing it.

00:28:27.962 --> 00:28:28.880
- We're doing it, we're doing it, right.

00:28:28.880 --> 00:28:30.407
So all they have to do is say,

00:28:30.407 --> 00:28:33.300
"We're gonna put a Tycon
on Mars or orbit Mars,"

00:28:33.300 --> 00:28:34.750
