00:28:47.390 --> 00:28:49.290
But there's no business case for that.

00:28:50.220 --> 00:28:52.000
He could do it as a one-off.

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:53.510
He could get together with Jeff Bezos

00:28:53.510 --> 00:28:55.097
