00:29:11.760 --> 00:29:13.087
What's my return on investment?

00:29:13.087 --> 00:29:14.410
"Nothing."

00:29:14.410 --> 00:29:15.960
That's a five-minute meeting.

00:29:15.960 --> 00:29:17.030
I say this all the time.

00:29:17.030 --> 00:29:18.690
That's a five-minute meeting.

00:29:18.690 --> 00:29:23.690
So unless we discover oil
on Mars, (laughs) diamonds.

00:29:24.160 --> 00:29:26.300
But China could do it for no other reason

00:29:26.300 --> 00:29:28.060
but that they wanna do it.

00:29:28.060 --> 00:29:31.760
'Cause if you're not a
completely free society,

00:29:31.760 --> 00:29:33.560
